Subject: [PATCH 06/16] core: add stdev, variance and their p/if forms

stdev, stdevif, stdevp, variance, varianceif, variancep and variancepif over
int, long and real. Sample statistics divide by n-1 (0 for one value),
population ones by n; no values gives null. Accumulated as count, sum and sum
of squares per chunk (NumericAggregate.SumOfSquares), so results combine
across chunks. Beaconing detections need stdev(gap)/avg(gap).
